{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47215","headline":"观大驾出叙事寄怀 · 法轮","name":"观大驾出叙事寄怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"紫台宵漏竭，青门曙鼓通。\n轻霞照复道，徐吹转相风。\n玉鸾光万骑，金舆郁五戎。\n鸣笳犹度阙，清跸尚喧宫。\n云旗乱陌紫，羽斾杂尘红。\n百城归北丽，两汉久惭雄。\n吾曹陋薄技，余庆洽微躬。\n平原已起洛，印手亦还丰。\n得奉衣冠盛，仍观书轨同。\n犹言待封告，未忍向华嵩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"法轮","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47215.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47215","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}